{"articleNo":"579333","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=579333&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2026년 대학일자리플러스센터 만족도 조사","writer":"취업지원본부","writeDate":"2026.10.13","hit":"15185","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmDYHoEYUhVAZgEwPIDsCK6BuAhAYQC0BXAZwCMAbMgDQDV0A5AOgAd0BzIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">고용노동부와 한국고용정보원에서는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">‘2026</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">년 대학일자리플러스센터 만족도 조사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">를 실시하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">본 조사는 대학일자리플러스사업 서비스 참여자의 만족도 조사를 통해 서비스 질 향상을 위한 목적으로 실사하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">조사대상</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:25.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">대학교일자리플러스센터 서비스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">상담</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">취업알선</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">비교과 프로그램 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">를 </span><br> <span lang=\"EN-US\">  이용한 경험이 있는 청년</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 25pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">졸업생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">지역청년 포함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 25pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">의대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">치대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">수의대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">약대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">한의대 제외</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">조사기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: 2026. 10. 13 ~ 10. 30</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">조사내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">청년정책 인지도 및 대학교일자리플러스센터에서 제공하는 서비스의 만족도</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">설문 참여는 소지하고 계신 모바일 기기 또는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">PC</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">를 활용하여 </span><br> <span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">아래 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">URL </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">접속 후 참여 가능하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, QR</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:11.0pt;\">코드를 통해서도 참여 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\"></p><table style=\"border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:191.94pt;height:2.82pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.28pt;background:#f2f2f2;\" valign=\"middle\"